  "id": "neo-spring-road-2001-best-in-japan",
  "name": "Neo Spring Road 2001 Best in Japan",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Battle★Neo Spring Road Best in Japan deciding match, the national final of the spring 2001 circuit, held at the Pokémon Center Tokyo on 31 March 2001 in a junior and a senior division. The top three of each won a cosmos holo No. 1, No. 2 or No. 3 Trainer card with the winner's own photograph and name in place of a drawn trainer, in front of Lugia, the circuit's emblem, and the Battle★Neo Spring Road logo. Only one of each was made. Where a winner shows in our pictures, we've blurred their name and face.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Pokémon Card Battle Neo Spring / Summer Road 2001",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/pokemon-card-battle-neo-spring-summer-road-2001/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: No.1 Trainer (Neo Spring Road Best in Japan 2001)",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/card/no-1-trainer-neo-spring-road-best-in-japan-2001-unnumbered/"
      }
    ]
  },
